name: fxc
os: RedHat, Ubuntu, Debian, Amazon
os_family: RedHat, Debian
min_salt_version: 3006.0
recommended_salt_version: 3007.0
root_dir: fxc
description: >
  Deploys the FXC simulated financial-market components (FxcExchange, FxcBroker, FxcPub,
  FxcInvestor) plus their MariaDB and Tigase XMPP infrastructure and the Locust load harness,
  natively (JDK + systemd, no containers) onto salt-cloud-provisioned AWS EC2 minions.
